      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/ebca7d/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2019-12-10T19:51:38.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mint for me.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>A really great strategy I found that I didn't get to exploit to its fullest was using the Environment (Training Facility) and VG Dr. Medico (Doctor's Orders, Lifeforce of Will, and Second Opinion) to load up Road Warrior Mainstay with uses of his Innate Power.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Then, before his next turn, if you can trigger a play of School Of Hard Knocks, Mainstay will proceed to lay the smackdown on everbody because Bring It! will trigger X times for each target, where X is the number of times the power was used. Especially great if Shard Strength is in play.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>It would make for an awsome splash panel at any rate.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
